<title>GREECE: SCHEDULE OF PROSPECTIVE SHAREHOLDERS MEETINGS.</title>
<headline>SCHEDULE OF PROSPECTIVE SHAREHOLDERS MEETINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>With the equities market entering</p>
<p>the peak of the annual shareholder meetings season the following</p>
<p>is a detailed schedule of forthcoming AGMs.</p>
<p>It will be updated as new AGMs are announced.</p>
<p>    COMPANY		  DATE     TIME    VENUE</p>
<p>Piraeus Invest   May 21   13:00   Meridien Hotel</p>
<p>Endysi	     May 21   15:30   Esperia Palace Hotel</p>
<p>Piraeus Bank     May 22   13:00   Grande Brettagne</p>
<p>						 *    Rights issue</p>
<p>Development Fund May 23   13:00   Grande Brettagne</p>
<p>Kekrops	    May 23   11:00   Company Headquarters</p>
<p>							Dafnis 6, P. Psyhiko</p>
<p>						 *    Bonus issue</p>
<p>Delta Inform     May 26   10:00   Grande Brettagne</p>
<p>						 *    Rights issue</p>
<p>Ergobank	   May 27   19:00   Hilton Hotel</p>
<p>AB Vasilopoulos  May 28   18:00   Pentelikon Hotel</p>
<p>						 *    Share conversion</p>
<p>Mac-Thrace Bank  May 28   12:00   Thessaloniki HQ</p>
<p>							Ethnikis Amynis 5-7</p>
<p>						 *    Bonus issue</p>
<p>GEK		 May 29   14:30   Esperia Palace Hotel</p>
<p>OTE		 May 29   12:00   Holiday Inn</p>
<p>Brittania	 May 30   13:30   Company HQ</p>
<p>							Lykourgou 80</p>
<p>							N.Filadelfia</p>
<p>						 *    Bonus issue</p>
<p>Vector	    May 30   10:00   President Hotel</p>
<p>						 *    Rights issue/merger</p>
<p>Hellenic Cables Jun 4    10:00   President Hotel</p>
<p>Titan Cement    Jun 4    12:00   Grande Brettagne</p>
<p>						 *    Bond issue/stock split</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
